      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاجَرَهُ</span></b> , (A,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَاجَرَةٌ</span>, (A, K,) (tropical:)  <i>He
